-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605790552" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605790552" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605790552" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605790552" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" >Captain Kirby</a></span></li> </ul> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="notice"><strong>欢迎，Archibald博士。</strong><br /> 您现正在编辑SCP-5510。您的会话将于闲置<strong>118</strong>秒后过期。</div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:100px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragment:scp-4182-1/blank.png" style="width:100px;" alt="blank.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:100px;"> <p><tt>[未选择文件]</tt></p> </div> </div> <p><strong>项目编号：</strong>SCP-5510</p> <p><strong>项目等级：</strong>Safe（暂定）</p> <p><strong>特殊收容措施：</strong>SCP-5510需保存于小型物品储柜中。确认测试正在进行中。</p> <p><strong>描述：</strong>SCP-5510为一个电视遥控器。项目功能正常运转，但其四个媒体导航按钮例外。当某个按键被按下之后，所经历的主观时间将受到异常改变。</p> <p><strong>附录5510-1：</strong>测试记录</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>按键</th> <th>结果</th> </tr> <tr> <td>快进</td> <td>SCP-5510以半速经历时间。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>倒带</td> <td>SCP-5510以倍速经历时间。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>播放</td> <td>无已知效果。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>暂停</td> <td><img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/scp-5510/cursor.png" alt="𝖨" width="10px" class="image" /></td> </tr> </table> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5509">SCP-5509</a> | SCP-5510 | <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5511">SCP-5511</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4915183&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605790552" alt="hoah2333" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4915183)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" >hoah2333</a></span></p> 
